25239079","description":"Marijuana","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5554-7e22-9580-5953487c513d","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7df1-b0c8-10e72868dcc8","question":"Who is credited with discovering penicillin?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Alexander Fleming\u2019s observation helped launch the antibiotic era, though other scientists later developed penicillin into a practical treatment.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5554-7eb7-8103-9dcbb9b81944","description":"Alexander Fleming","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5554-7f4a-81f8-cf084ea0f85a","description":"Louis Pasteur","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5554-7c2d-a8f9-6e1cb09529f2","description":"Frederick Sanger","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5554-7c2d-982b-48379f170b19","description":"John Dalton","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5554-75c2-ab83-484d723990ee","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7df1-b0c8-10e72868dcc8","question":"What is another word for \"masticating\"?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Chewing breaks food into smaller pieces and mixes it with saliva; swallowing moves food into the throat, while digestion is the broader process of breaking it down.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5554-7def-9434-18deb5c1ad5d","description":"Chewing","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5554-78f4-a336-b032b38db434","description":"Swallowing","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5554-7fba-8eba-4d92322a50c1","description":"Digesting","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5554-7def-9d4d-d7b735693dfc","description":"Salivating","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5554-7964-9efa-990009d7bfa4","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7df1-b0c8-10e72868dcc8","question":"What would you call a female elephant?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A cow is an adult female elephant; males are called bulls, and young elephants are calves.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5554-7d2e-b6ff-d4d1a47b3d75","description":"A Cow","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5