ffected by a lobotomy?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"The frontal lobe contains the prefrontal cortex, which supports planning and judgment. Lobotomies disrupted its connections and could cause major changes in personality and behavior.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5555-7565-ade4-4b2c8d1dea74","description":"Frontal lobe","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5555-7f4a-8c4c-d15235aa23e1","description":"Temporal lobe","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5555-792b-bece-186386798b4a","description":"Occipital lobe","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5555-77a4-8ef6-d32608cff08b","description":"Cerebellum","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5555-7793-847e-dc5d201ed06a","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7df1-b0c8-10e72868dcc8","question":"Which soft, purplish organ filters blood and stores platelets?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"The spleen also supports immune defenses and removes aging red blood cells from circulation.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5555-7211-87bc-691dc08c70cb","description":"Spleen","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5555-7307-8f64-67f30fb02770","description":"Pancreas","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5555-7c2c-9ad4-7f9c1da94b1c","description":"Gallbladder","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5555-7dfe-8376-c5d30fe659fb","description":"Appendix","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5555-7336-bbd1-f244cc249153","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7df1-b0c8-10e72868dcc8","question":"The \"canebrake\", \"timber\" and \"pygmy\" are types of what\"?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A rattlesnake\'s rattle is made of interlocking segments of keratin that vibrate when the tail shakes.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5555-7acc-b25e-b45144bbb6ca","description":"Rattlesnake","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5555-7ceb-b438-582420e09db2","description":"Coyote","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5555-7121-850d-de335a7f9c9c","description":"Goose","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5555-760a-8